  <p class="eyebrow">For hospices, departments and education teams</p>
  <h1>One licence for your whole team</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">You can buy The Monday Clinical Brief for all your staff. There is one annual fee. Staff sign up with their work email and pay nothing.</p>
  <div class="head-actions">
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:info@mondayclinicalbrief.co.uk?subject=Organisation%20licence">Ask about a licence</a>
    <a class="quiet" href="/samples/">See a sample issue</a>
  </div>
